Description: Implements Bayesian inference for Bradley–Terry paired-comparison
    models and Plackett–Luce ranking models with optional latent item blocks.
    Provides Gibbs-type MCMC samplers, posterior relabeling, diagnostics, and
    visualisation utilities for skill clusters and block interaction strengths.
    Useful for applications in sports analytics, psychometrics, preference
    learning, and ranking problems with latent group structures.
